        "answer": {
          "short": "$3z=5$, $z=1\\frac{2}{3}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3z&=5\\\\\\frac{3z}{3}&=\\frac{5}{3}\\\\z&=1\\frac{2}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
